  "lore": [
    {
      "id": "lore-01",
      "text": "The shrine-bonfire is the last light against the dark; feed it and it feeds you.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-02",
      "text": "The Abyss does not want to kill you. It wants you to understand.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-03",
      "text": "The Violence wears your own fists, and it has been practicing longer.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-04",
      "text": "The Cunning never moves. It does not need to.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-05",
      "text": "The Unknown does not hate you. It simply does not recognise combat.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-06",
      "text": "Every boss is a mirror. Look closely and you will see the monster is wearing your face.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-07",
      "text": "The merchants do not fear the deep. They have already sold their souls.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-08",
      "text": "The Brawler's hands remember every establishment that threw him out.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-09",
      "text": "The Hunter's woods are silent now. The city is not.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-10",
      "text": "The Alchemist understands the dungeon is an infinite bazaar \u2014 and an infinite source of knowledge.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-11",
      "text": "Light the bonfire. Rest. The descent is one-way, but home is never far from a flame.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-12",
      "text": "Components are not treasure. They are the price of a checkpoint.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-13",
      "text": "Bosses guard the way down. Defeat them, and their skill becomes yours.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-14",
      "text": "Gold buys steel. Steel buys survival. Survival buys more gold.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-15",
      "text": "The deeper you go, the more the walls remember.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-16",
      "text": "Essence is the soul's residue. The Alchemist knows how to spend it.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-17",
      "text": "A summoned ally is not loyal. It is simply not yet your enemy.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-18",
      "text": "Traps are patience made physical. The Hunter has plenty of patience.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-19",
      "text": "Frenzy is a debt. It is always collected.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-20",
      "text": "The parish bells ring for no one. They ring to keep something in.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-21",
      "text": "The ossuary keeps the bones in tidy rows. They were not always tidy.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-22",
      "text": "The sewers carry more than water. They carry what the city flushed away.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-23",
      "text": "The library burned once. The books remember being burned.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-24",
      "text": "The gallows is the only place in the deep that is honest.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-25",
      "text": "The chapel's windows are stained with more than paint.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-26",
      "text": "Do not trust the fog. It has seen you.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-27",
      "text": "Every enemy was once something else. The parts remember.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-28",
      "text": "The dungeon does not generate itself. Something is writing it.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-29",
      "text": "There is no way back, only deeper. The bonfire is the exception.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
      "is_canonical": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lore-30",
      "text": "Heirs of the Abyss: the dungeon's children, descending into their inheritance.",
      "tags": [
        "gothic",
        "canon"
      ],
